<title>UK: Korea Development Bank sets 150 mln stg 3-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Korea Development Bank sets 150 mln stg 3-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   SPREAD     12.50 BP  MATURITY    06.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.951    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
